# Scratch dir: holds captured browser profiles (cookies, session tokens)
tmp/

# The nested live project. It was tracked as a gitlink (mode 160000) with no
# .gitmodules entry, so any clone that updates submodules fails outright —
# which is exactly what broke the first Cloudflare Workers build for
# agxtrade.com ("error occurred while updating repository submodules").
# It is a separate ~3GB repo that deliberately stays local-only, so ignore it
# rather than re-adding it: committing its contents here would be far worse
# than the broken build.
/AgenticAI-Trading 2/
